OL,3,AOasis' Cardiff reunion gig was 'hugely
OL,4,Aemotional' say film-makers
OL,5,
OL,6,FOasis' reunion gig at Cardiff's
OL,7,FPrincipality Stadium was a "hugely
OL,8,Femotional" experience that took Noel
OL,9,FGallagher by surprise, the directors of
OL,10,Fa film charting the brothers' comeback
OL,11,Ftour have said.
OL,13,FWill Lovelace and Dylan Southern's
OL,14,Fportrayal of the band's world tour in
OL,15,F2025 also captured the moment Liam and
OL,16,FNoel reunited in the rehearsal studios
OL,17,Ffollowing a 15-year hiatus.
OL,19,FReflecting on the opening gig, Southern
OL,20,Fsaid: "You saw grown men who probably
OL,21,Frarely express their emotions crying
OL,22,Fand hugging each other.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,167,160,200,105,0,100
