OL,3,AOasis' Cardiff reunion gig was 'hugely
OL,4,Aemotional' say film-makers
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Noel says in the film that he
OL,7,Fcompletely underestimated what it would
OL,8,Fbe like, and it really did kind of hit
OL,9,Fhim hard."
